<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">Solomon La</book>
  <para style="h">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc1">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="toc2">Solomon La</para>
  <para style="mt">Solomon La</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Late lahah a ngaih pen, Solomon’ la:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mi tawpna a phune tawh keima ei tawp valeh le ci’ng! Azieh pen in vang nei ngaina ningzu sangin hlumcia zaw sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nu sathau tumtai bangin namtui sang e, na sahmin khu gimsi namtui kibuo bang e; tua ahi ziehin lienute in mu banga ang ngai ding ma hi cie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na banzalin ei kai inlen, kinaw tanaw’n kitai ta vai. Ama’ zalna laikhun tungah vaimang in ma lobang ei tut. Selung tai-in na sieng nenah limnga bangin hing lam va ung; vang nei ngaina ningzu hlum sang’ hing pawhzaw vang; na senngaihte’n mu banga ang ngai tahtah hi mel teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem lienute aw, ka sahmel puoh vom nanle zong Solomon in a Kedar limbuh sunga a khaipuonte bangin etin lawm ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tungsun ni in ei kadupin, ka sahmel puoh a vom manin, nuisiemin hong lel lo aw ngaih. Ka tun vontawi tang laizomte’n keima’ kungtung sinlung sit uh; ei zunsah uh lengga huonlei, keima’ lenghuon ham bang huoi la’ng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tong lel ve aw, duongzen ngaihno, khawi le vulte koi kuom sawl bang heisah na hiam? Sunkim tangni a ham lai-in koi kuom sam bang zalsah na hiam? Tuucing na tangguolte lai-ah zezum lienu zil ding ka hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zatam lienute za lai-ah duong kikhai pen ningniang nu aw, sinlung lai-a na thei sih leh, tuuhonte’ zawi sul bang zui-in, tuucingte’ limbuh pang no-ah na tuunote siel bang’ cing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngaino aw, Pharaoh’ lengkai kolsa-laa khat’ pien zil hing sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na bienga kai duong zepna le na ngawnga viel awkhi nunsan etin lawm sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na duongsuo zepna khamgui awkhi hing bawl va ung, ngun khainiengin hing zem va ung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zalkhun tungah vaimang sam bang’ a zal laitah, ka duong zunna nard gimsi hing leng kuom teng zel e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka sannem no, anglai nunkhum nigel kalah, myrrh thawl khai dung zil sa’ng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sannem no ka kung tungah En-gedi lenggui huona a po henna pape dung no zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ah, ka sen ngaino, sahduong kikhai dingdiang ma cie; ah, sahduong kikhai dingdiang ma cie; na maimit in khuva maimit pien dung zil sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ah, ka sen ngaino sahduong kikhai dingdiang ma cie, ka duong eizen keima’ laikuoi tahtah hi cie. I laikhun zong khawlo bangin dum dieldiel e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saunuom i innkamte aw e; taamtah gilsing san singseng aw. Saunuom i innsunte aw e, taah san gil singa kibawl aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sharon lingpaa keima hi’ng e, muolkuom unoh paape hi’ng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lingsie kawma unoh paa bang, a guol lai-ah ka sen ngaino khum bang hi ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangguol lai-ah ka sannem no, gammang tulsing a zalai-ah tulsing apple po dung zil sa’ng. Sinlung tai-in tangpa hlimah tutvum khawl ing. A tulsing ga kei adingin, ning zu bangin hlum vangut e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nunnop bawlna sau hlim nenah ma bang ei pui, tangpa lailung a gelna teng lienu mu bang ei ngaina hi ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Duongzen sawl bang ka vul ziehin, lenggagaw le apple ga tawh ka zeitha tawl ei damsah ven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banzal veilam ei khamsahin, banzal zietin ei kawi leh ci’ng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem lienute aw, vang kingaina kam mei banga a kuon masie, va bang phawngin thel bang thosah sih va ung ci’n, khisa no le zuhsiel minin ka sieng nenah tong hing ciem un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa tongdam za ing! Maimit suon ven, ma cieng hing suon, a muoltang tawn sangsa no bang, macieng suonin tawndien valeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngai tangpa zuhsa no le khisatalno dung zil hi e. Maimit suon ven, kawmpal hemah ka ngaino ding, tawlet panin gal ei don ei, vathang kawm pan maimit ei suon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka senngai no’n ka sieng nenah tongdam hing lel: “Ka ngai duongsuo melhoi no aw, zuong hing tho-in ka sieng sul bang ei zui in ci.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biphal daidam meii bang theng ta, tuoiguo lenmuol hemlam kai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Simlei paape a pallun ta; nopna zeila awi hun tung ta, i gam lei-ah huiva nu’ tong luon no kiza.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khangthei kungte’n a ga suong ta, lengga pallun gimsi lang ta; duongsuo etlawm, ka sen ngaino, zuong hing tho-in ka sieng sul bang ei zui bo ven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawlpang lum suong kawma kibu, khuva no aw, na langmai suo ei musah in, na tongnem no ei luon taven; na tongdam no ningzu bang hlum, na langmai zong ngaibang hiuhiau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I huon lenggui ang pallun ta, gam siegul bang i leng kungte a susie ding si-alte le si-al note henkol bul in,” ci’n tong ei lel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngai kei-a’, kei ama-a’ hi’ng; Unoh paapete zalai-ah khawi le vulte ham bangin huoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zingdam vulkhi a lan masang, khimzing zanmiel a ven masang, duongkuoi ka sen ngaino aw e, khisa no le zuhsa no bang, a muoltang tawn sul hing hei ta’n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A zankhuo sawt laikhun tungah lunga ka gul ka lai kuoi pa sa bang vai ing; sa bang ka vai zu bang maimaw’ng; mal bang ko ing tong dawng lo e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tu’n zuong tho-in vang khuo lai-ah pheiphung suonin laileng vangin, tuonglam dung le tuolzang tengah sulhei kawi vang; laikuoi ngaihno sa bang vai vang,” ci’n lung gel ing. Sa bang ka vai zu bang maimaw’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuonglam lai-ah dawn bang kituo, vangkhuo vil ding macieng suonte. “Mu bang ka ngai ka sannem no koi kuom sawl bang a hei tai,” ci’n tongin dong ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nungsie’n sul bang’n kei ka hei leh ka sen ngaihno mel khu mu ing. Ka sen ngaihno nau bang kawi-ing, mim bang pienna tunnu sauhlim laikhun tung tuong ka tut masang, sam bang khen ding lungin gel maw’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem lienute aw, vang kingaina kammei banga a kuon masie, va bang phawngin thel bang thosah sih va ung ci’n, khisa no le zuhsiel minin ka sieng nenah tong hing ciem un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Panamtui le myrrh kopin, sesum bawlte’n gimsi namcin kaitui bang gawm, kam mei-ah hal, senel gam pan meikhu vaivut bang kitungsah, macieng ang suon singta vontawi koi pen ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maimit suon vawi, Solomon’ taal! A kimvelah sawm guh a sim, tang ngalliem Israel-te’n lum bang sung uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />zankhang lai-a patau kona, a mi zatamte’n namtem kuo, dogal siemte’n a kawng ciet vuah namtem khai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaimang Solomon taalbuh aw e, Lebanon tulsing gil tawh zun e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngun tawh kizut a luoikhuomte, a nualam teng khamin kizem, a mang topha silpuon sandupin kivon e. A sunglam teng itna silpuonin khu mel uh. Jerusalem liepalte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na pheiphung uh hing suon ve vuo. Jerusalem lienute aw, vaimang Solomon khu, a angkawi tawh kaitui banga a kigawm ni, a tunnu in a tuhlu-ah a lal lukhu pi a khusah ni galin don un, ama dingin a sin lailung a dam ni hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sen ngaino duongsuo kilawm, na duong melhoi kikhai dingdiang! Na khudiel tawh na maimit gel khuva maimit dung no zil e. Na basam zong Gilead tanga lengkel honte tuolkum zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tuhha pa silselte’n zong besam kimet damtui-a buol pheiphung suonto tuuhon dung zil, a unsiengin a kopin pieng, mal a tuom kai ci om lo e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sam khau san bang’ na muh kilawm, na tongsuo zong ningzu bang khum. Langmai khuna dielvang kawm pan na bieng gel no, mang kawlsing ga phalsuo zil e, san pimpem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngawng zang khu tang ngalliemte’n tulkhat a sim a lum khaina, a guola cien David’ dawsang dung no zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na anglai-a nunkhum ni gel unoh papete zalai-ah sawl a hei khawm, zuhsa pengkop khisa no ni duong zil hi e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingdam vulkhi a lan masang, zingdam taikhuo a val masang, myrrh muol le gimsi namtui a muoltangah muol khup zuai vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sen ngaihno, duong kikhaikim zo ma cie maw; na kung tung teng kawbang sih teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima’ angkawi ding nu aw e, Lebanon pan kei tawh zawh vai. Lebanon pan kei tawh zawh vai. Sangsa limlien humpi zalna kuo le sangsa kamkei sawl bang heina a lenmuolte, lenmuol Amana aw, Amana kuivum lenmuol Senir, Hermon-te khu nungsie inlen macieng suon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka angkawi ding ka sannem no, ka sin lunglai ei kuoi luo teh, na ngawng awkhi suongmanpha tawh khatvei hemlam maimit nei paih, ka sin lunglai ei kuoi luo teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka angkawi ding ka sannem no, vang nei ngaina ningzu bang khum! Vang nei ngaina ningzu sang zong hlum cia zaw lai, na nu sathau tumtai sang zong namtui zaw sa’ng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Angkawi ding nu, na phune pan paazu hlumno dai bang taasuh, na dangtawngah ningkhuoizu le sebawng nunkhum li bang kicing. Lebanon gam gimsi bangin na silpuonte namtui sa ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Angkawi ding nu ka sannem no, deizun huonlei imtuom no aw, deizun huonlei imtuom no aw, a samtui nah imtuom no aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na huonlei ah tulsing namcin, gathei minlun mang kawlsing le, henna le nard tulsingte tawh ci bang deiteel gathei minlunte tawh poton.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Namtui tulsing li bang cinna nard le saffron, calamus le cinnamon-te, myrrh, aloes gimsi namtui, kaitui banga gawmna hi cie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khanghuon samtui, hinna tuikhuh no zong hi cie, Lebanon tang tawn a luong damtui no zong hi cie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zuong hing tho in, mal vulkhi aw, hing langto ven sim vulkhi aw! Ka khanghuon teng hing sem inlen, namtui gimsi’n muncin zel heh. Ka sen ngaino’n a khanghuon ah, pheiphung suonin, ci bang deiteel gathei minlun hing ciemsah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ang kawi ding ka sen ngaino, ka khanghuon-ah tuong hing tung ta’ng; ka myrrh le gimsi namtui, ham bang huoi ing, ka khuoibal le ka ningkhuoizu ka kime a, ka ningzu le sebawng nunkhum kimeton ing. Guolngai teng aw, ne-in dawn un, vang kingaina ningzu bangin kitekham un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laikhun tungah saam bangin kei zal zong nanleng, khangthei lo ing, maimit sing maw’ng. Ngaidi vawi ven! ka senngai in dawngkot ei kiu. “Dawngkot hong in, duongkuoi lienu, ka sannem no, keima’ khuva lel banglo nu. Ka sumlu teng zing daitui in nomsah sieng ta, ka zangsam-ah zan daitui taa, tehlop sieng ta’ng,” ci-in tong lel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka silpuonte hawhmang zo ta’ng; bangci kivonkia ding ka diei? Ka pheiphungte sil sieng zo ta’ng; bangci niehsah kia ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sannem in awngvang panin banzal ei hlah, lie sinlung lai kulthuh dongah ei zen ma cie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dawngkot hon ding zuong tho ing e, ka sen ngaino. Ka banzal zong myrrh gimsi namsah ing e. Ka khutme-a myrrh gimsi’n kotgol tung dongin zelsah e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngaino ding dawngkot hong ing, nungsie sul bang, ka sen ngaino na hei zo ta. Ka ngaino in tong a lel cieng ka sinlung lai pat puon bang nem. Sa bang ka vai, zu bang maimaw’ng; a min mal bang koko zong leng, ka sen ngaino’n tong dawng lo e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vangkhuo vila vahkawite tawh ka heina-ah dawn bang kituo. Vangkhuo vila vahkawite in mel ei mu uh; a banzal un kei ei satin, ei liemsah uh. Kawmpal dawn a galvilte in lie kei silpuon tuolhawh ta uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem lienute aw, ka ngai mela na mu uleh duongzen umlai a veina-in sawl bang vul ta, ci’n na lel un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zatam lienute kawmkalah duong kikhai pen ka lienu aw, na sen ngaino a guol lai-ah duong kikhaituom dieh a hiam aw? Hi zata tong lel nadingin a guol lai-ah duong kikhaituom dieh ahiam aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngai melhoi vang tang silsel, dam mel puo-in san sipsep e, tang guol tulsawmte zalai-ah ka ngaino ma piendang pen sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sumlu zong kham citah pen dung zil hi e, zangsam kawisiem, aahva bangin vom siem sang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A maimit zong khuva maimit no khu bang a, sikhuh pieu nen nunkhum a buol , khuvanote dung zil hi e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A biengte’n zong namtui tulsing li bang cinna huonlei dung zil. A phune khu myrrh gimsi sunga kidie unoh paapete dung zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A banzal khu khamkuol kiviel, mantam suongzep dung zil san’g e. A duongsuo khu vuisai halep zunnel tunga sapphires suong tawh kizem bang sa’ng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pheiphungte kham khuom bul a, suongngo khuom tun no khu bang e. A langmai zong lenmuol Lebanon taamtah tulsing hoipen dung zil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tongdam khu ningzu bang khum, sil bang kimah ngaibang luo sa’ng. Jerusalem lienute aw, kei ka senngai ama hi e, ka sen lawmpa zong khu hi ei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zatam lienute zalai-ah duong kikhai pen nu no aw e, na sen ngaino koi kuom macieng suon ahiei maw? Koi kuom sawl bang hei a hiam maw? Na san nemno nang tawh sa bang vai ton nuom ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gimnam tulsing li bang cinna a khanghuon-ah, ka sannem no vailo kuon e. A khanghuon-ah a tuuhonte ham bang huoi ding, unoh paapete khawm dingin ka sen ngaino vailo kuon ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngai kei-a’, kei ama-a’, Unoh pal huon a zalai-ah a tuuhonte khing-an tul e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Duongsuo melhoi, ka sen ngaino, Tirzah vangkhuo dung zil hi cie, Jerusalem vangkhuo bangin etin lawm teh. Khaidielte tawh lal ma a nawh galkap hon bang giinhuoi ma cie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na maimitin ei suon nawn si’n, ka sin lunglai ei zen luo teh! Na besam in lengkel honte Gilead tang tawn tuolkum zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tuhha pa silselte in besam kimet damtui-a buol pheiphung suonto tuuhon dung zil. A unsiengin a kopin pieng, mal a tuom kai ci om lo e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Langmai khuna dielvang kawm pan na bieng no gel, mang kawlsing ga phalsuo zilin san pimpem uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaimang angkawi sawmguhte le, a meite zong a sawmgiet-a sim, zatam lienute ahile sim zawh hi sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Duong kikhaikim, ka khuva no ka sinlai kuoi nang beh hi teh. Tunnu vontawi deituom hi e, pienna tunnu ding’ nuol bei sa’ng. Lie zatamte’n mel a mu cieng, nunnuom nga bang lamnu ci uh. Vaimang angkawi le a meite’n ka ngai lienu lam bang pah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Zingdam taikhuo val dung zilin, tung solkha tang banga etlawm, sunni vangtang dung no zilin, lal nawh dinga khaidiel teng tawh pal bang kicieng galkap hon bang, a giinhuoi khu koi ta ahiei?” ci’n tong lel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuom thuh a po tulsing pate gathang banga a vil ding le lengguite in dawn a suong tai, mang kawlsingte a pal lun tai cia, maimit suon ding tulsing huon-ah vailo kuon ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka sin lung a ka thei masang, ka lailungin vaimang nen a kolleng tungah kei va to ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Shulam lienu! Sul hing hei ven, sul hing vei ven, nangma’ duongsuo ka maimitin ka suon nading, sul hing hei in, sul hing hei in. Galkap guolni ciente’ mai-a lamvui et bang, a bang dingin Shulam lie-te na mai mitun suon na hi vuoi?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lengnu melpuo lanu no aw, na pheiphung le na kedapte etin lawm e! Na pheizum gel banzal siemte suong manpha zun no khu bang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na laimu khu kuong bangin kuoh, ningzu lawi lo ningbel no bang. Ngai na gil zong unoh pal um, mangbu sunvum dung zil sang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na anglai-a nunkhum ni gel zuhsa ni le khisa pengkop no khu bang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngaino na ngawng vuisai halep dawsang dung zil. Na maimit zong Bath-rabbim dawngkot nen a Heshbon dimtui dung no zil e. Na nahkuo khu vangkhuo Damascus-a pieng Lebanon dawsang no dung zil e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na sumlu-a na khuhlu khu Carmel lenmuol vum no sun sang, na besam a kaisuhte khu silpuon sandup no khu bang e. A sambawh khu etin lawm e, vaimang’ henkol bul law na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kang it vatuh, lungdei lanu! na duongsuo khu etin lawm sa’ng, ka lungtaina nangma hi teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na duong kikhai lutu mam bang, na anglai-a nunkhum nigel a ga lunlaite khu bang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A gam tulsing lutu dawnah baah bangin kei va kai vangin, ka banzal tawh a bazamte mawng bang va kawi tavang ci-in, tong hing lel ing. Na ang lai-a nunkhum nigel lengga bangin bawh pha hinlen, nangma’ husan gimnamte’n zong tulta apple gim zil taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima nei tawpnate zong khu haning kawm le kam sung zui-a a hing luong suh, ningzu hlumpen dung zil taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngaino-a’ khu ka hi hi, a lungdei pen keima ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hing leng vawi ven ka sen ngaino, gam tulta-ah va lai lengin vangkhuo tengah zankhuo sawtin sam bang zal vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lengguite zong tangna bangin a dawn suong tai, lengkungte zong a pa huomin mang kawlsingte a pallun tai, taikhuo val cieng maimit suon ding, laikhun tung pan zuongtho vai-in, lengga huon-ah vai lo kuon vai. Na vang mu bang ka ngaina teng nang pie sieng vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zawl-ai gimsi no hing lang ta, lungdei gasing namcin teng zong dawng kotbiengah li bang kicing. Gathei lui le gathei thate nang koipieh ing, ka sen ngai aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tang laizom, tunnu anglai nunkhum luoipi hi lacin maw! Tuonglam lai-ah dawn bang tuo-in kang tawptawp zong singtate’n zong nuisiemin ei lel sih va uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mim bang pienna tunnu saunuom, laikhun tungah hing pui nuom ing. Ningzu khum le mang kawlsing tui hing tultul vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banzal veilam ei khamsahin, banzal zietlamin ei kawi le ci’ng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem lienute aw, vang kingaina kam mei bangin a kuon masie, va bang phawngin thel bang thosah sih va ung ci’n ka sieng nenah tong hing ciem un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Senel gam pan pheiphung ang suon, a ngai tunga kingam nu khu kuo ta lie vontawi ahi maw? Na tunnu in umlai veilaw mim bang pienna tulsing apple hlim nei no-ah tang lo bangin ke’n hing phong ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na banzal khu melcina khat a kitup bang, na sinlungah melcina khat ei tuppieh in; vang kingaina sikuong bang hat, lung gulna zong hankhuh bangin huoisie vengvong. Kam meisi bang kithezahin kam meikuong bang sa vapom e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vang kingaina situi tampi’n sumit zo sih, tuikhang in zong taimang zo sih. Gou le gamh tawh vang kingaina lei sawm hi lei, nuisiem lelna’n ei kinei va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anglai nunkhum a baw nai lo tuoi lienu khat nei na lai ui. Singta’n tongdam hing lel uleh i tuoi lienu bang i law diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I laizom nu kawmpal hi leh ngun a kibawl dawsa bangin gie bang zunin, i laizom nu dawngkot hi leh, tulsing taamtah peh tawh zun vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima kawmpal kicieng hi’ng e, ka nunkhum gel dawsang bang e. Ka sen ngaino’ maimit sungah lemna a puoh nu khu bang ing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A gam min law Baal-hamon ah Solomon in leng huon khat nei. Tua lenghuon khu a hlo dingin losapte siengah ap ta ei. Ham bang a huoi losapte kung, singga manh ding ngun tulkhat kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka lengga lei, keima’ aituom, keima-a’ hi. Solomon aw, tulkhat tang in; losapte in a lawman dingin zani tang heh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khanghuon a buol ka ngaino aw, khawlpi ka guol ngaino teng in na tongdam nemno khu ngai uh, keima zong khu ei zasah ven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tumtai gimsi namcin pona lenmuol sang tung, zuhsano le khisano bang, ka sieng laituol ang leng dingin, sen ngaino aw, hing kinaw ta’n!
  </para>
</usx>
